<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean output losses seen at $2.3 billion - govt.</title>
<headline>S.Korean output losses seen at $2.3 billion - govt.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean production losses due to nationwide wide strikes would reach 1.96 trillion won ($2.3 billion) by the end of Monday, a government official said.</p>
</text>
